n":[{"type":"text","value":"Die Menge der Token, die wir minten, wird für Dezimalstellen \"normalisiert\". Das bedeutet, wenn wir 1 Token mit 6 Dezimalstellen minten wollen, müssen wir tatsächlich ","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":1006},"end":{"line":17,"column":170,"offset":1173}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"1_000_000","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":170,"offset":1173},"end":{"line":17,"column":181,"offset":1184}}},{"type":"text","value":" als Betrag angeben","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":181,"offset":1184},"end":{"line":17,"column":200,"offset":1203}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":1006},"end":{"line":17,"column":200,"offset":1203}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1,"offset":1004},"end":{"line":17,"column":200,"offset":1203}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"So sieht der CPI zur ","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":1207},"end":{"line":19,"column":22,"offset":1228}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"approve()","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":22,"offset":1228},"end":{"line":19,"column":33,"offset":1239}}},{"type":"text","value":" Anweisung aus:","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":33,"offset":1239},"end":{"line":19,"column":48,"offset":1254}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1,"offset":1207},"end":{"line":19,"column":48,"offset":1254}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"approve(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        Approve {\r\n            to: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            delegate: ctx.accounts.delegate.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n    &1_000_000,\r\n)?;","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":1258},"end":{"line":33,"column":4,"offset":1611}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-0"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Und so sieht der CPI zur ","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1,"offset":1615},"end":{"line":35,"column":26,"offset":1640}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"revoke()","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":26,"offset":1640},"end":{"line":35,"column":36,"offset":1650}}},{"type":"text","value":" Anweisung aus:","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":36,"offset":1650},"end":{"line":35,"column":51,"offset":1665}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1,"offset":1615},"end":{"line":35,"column":51,"offset":1665}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"revoke(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        Revoke {\r\n            pub source: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1,"offset":1669},"end":{"line":47,"column":4,"offset":1947}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":47,"column":4,"offset":1947}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# Approve- und Revoke-Anweisungen\r\n\r\nApprove erteilt einem Delegierten die Berechtigung, eine bestimmte Menge an Token im Namen des Kontoinhabers zu übertragen. Dies ermöglicht programmgesteuerte Token-Übertragungen, ohne die vollständige Kontrolle über das Konto zu gewähren.\r\n\r\n> Wir legen einen \"genehmigten\" Betrag fest, und der Delegierte kann nur bis zu diesem Betrag übertragen\r\n\r\nRevoke entzieht dem aktuellen Delegierten die Berechtigung über das Konto und gibt die vollständige Kontrolle an den Kontoinhaber zurück.\r\n\r\n> Hebt sofort jede bestehende Delegation auf, und nur der Kontoinhaber kann die Delegation widerrufen (nicht der Delegierte selbst)\r\n\r\nBevor wir ein Token-Konto delegieren oder widerrufen können, müssen wir bereits Folgendes haben:\r\n- Ein initialisiertes `Mint` Konto.\r\n- Ein initialisiertes `Token` Konto oder `Associated Token` Konto, über das wir die Kontrolle übernehmen wollen\r\n\r\n> Die Menge der Token, die wir minten, wird für Dezimalstellen \"normalisiert\". Das bedeutet, wenn wir 1 Token mit 6 Dezimalstellen minten wollen, müssen wir tatsächlich `1_000_000` als Betrag angeben\r\n\r\nSo sieht der CPI zur `approve()` Anweisung aus:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\napprove(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        Approve {\r\n            to: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            delegate: ctx.accounts.delegate.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n    &1_000_000,\r\n)?;\r\n```\r\n\r\nUnd so sieht der CPI zur `revoke()` Anweisung aus:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nrevoke(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        Revoke {\r\n            pub source: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"approve"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"("}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"    CpiContext"}]},{"type":"element","tagName"